WEBVTT

00:03.400 --> 00:06.960
<b>Tenth Year of Tenpo, Winter</b>

00:15.760 --> 00:17.850
<b>The weather's getting colder.</b>

00:18.390 --> 00:19.970
<b>It's still fine for now,</b>

00:20.060 --> 00:22.560
<b>but it will be tough soon.</b>

00:23.440 --> 00:25.770
<b>It's a shrine where the shrine maiden
worships the God of Fire.</b>

00:25.850 --> 00:28.110
<b>At the very least,
they should've placed a brazier.</b>

00:30.360 --> 00:32.110
<b>It'd be a problem if a fire broke out.</b>

00:32.190 --> 00:34.780
<b>Besides, this room has poor ventilation.</b>

00:34.860 --> 00:36.240
<b>It can't be helped.</b>

00:36.320 --> 00:37.950
<b>That may be true,</b>

00:38.030 --> 00:39.870
<b>but I still feel cold.</b>

00:39.950 --> 00:42.250
<b>It's not like I don't understand.</b>

00:42.330 --> 00:46.120
<b>By the way, didn't it occur to you
to say something like, "I'll warm you up"?</b>

00:46.960 --> 00:48.880
<b>What nonsense are you saying?</b>

00:50.460 --> 00:52.300
<b>Looks like you're still
a clueless little kid.</b>

00:58.680 --> 01:01.100
<b>Jinta, you're hopeless.</b>

01:01.680 --> 01:04.850
<b>You can't do anything
without your big sister around.</b>

01:04.940 --> 01:07.440
<b>You're obviously younger than me.</b>

01:26.460 --> 01:31.090
<b>Sword of the Demon Hunter</b>

02:46.080 --> 02:48.080
<b>You'd like me to go to Modorigawa?</b>

02:48.160 --> 02:49.080
<b>That's right.</b>

02:49.160 --> 02:51.000
<b>We don't know what it is yet,</b>

02:51.080 --> 02:56.050
<b>but there's no denying that there's
a strange creature lurking in Modorigawa.</b>

02:58.220 --> 02:59.300
<b>Jinta.</b>

02:59.380 --> 03:01.130
<b>Your mission this time</b>

03:01.220 --> 03:03.050
<b>is to find out the true nature
of that creature.</b>

03:03.140 --> 03:06.140
<b>If you discover that it brings harm
to Kadono, then eliminate it.</b>

03:06.890 --> 03:07.930
<b>As you command.</b>

03:08.020 --> 03:10.850
<b>I will carry out the mission to hunt it.</b>

03:11.480 --> 03:14.190
<b>Well then, Lady Itsukihime.</b>

03:18.740 --> 03:20.610
<b>Now then, everyone present,</b>

03:20.700 --> 03:23.370
<b>following the assignment
of the demon-hunting mission,</b>

03:23.450 --> 03:26.490
<b>I have an announcement to make as well.</b>

03:26.580 --> 03:30.660
<b>The Guardian of the Shrine Maiden is
a bodyguard handpicked by Lady Itsukihime</b>

03:30.750 --> 03:33.080
<b>and plays a vital role
in protecting the village.</b>

03:33.170 --> 03:35.790
<b>The current Guardian is Jinta.</b>

03:35.880 --> 03:40.720
<b>His swordsmanship surpasses
that of his predecessor, Motoharu's.</b>

03:40.800 --> 03:42.760
<b>However, since the previous famine,</b>

03:42.840 --> 03:45.640
<b>the number of demons running rampant
across the land has clearly increased.</b>

03:45.720 --> 03:49.470
<b>Now, even Modorigawa is rumored
to be inhabited by a strange creature.</b>

03:49.560 --> 03:53.230
<b>Many have tried to break into Kadono.</b>

03:54.020 --> 03:59.070
<b>Though it has been an old tradition that
a single Guardian protects the Itsukihime,</b>

03:59.150 --> 04:03.530
<b>do you not find this custom ill-suited
to the current state of affairs?</b>

04:04.280 --> 04:05.780
<b>Therefore,</b>

04:06.870 --> 04:09.790
<b>while Jinta is on his mission
to hunt demons, I'd like</b>

04:09.870 --> 04:15.420
<b>to appoint another Shrine Maiden's
Guardian to protect Lady Itsukihime.</b>

04:15.500 --> 04:17.420
<b>What?</b>

04:17.500 --> 04:20.170
<b>He needs no further introduction.</b>

04:20.260 --> 04:23.340
<b>This is my son, Kiyomasa.</b>

04:23.430 --> 04:26.180
<b>I'm Kiyomasa, the Shrine Maiden's
Guardian from now on.</b>

04:26.260 --> 04:29.520
<b>I look forward to working with you.</b>

04:29.600 --> 04:32.060
<b>His swordsmanship may not match Jinta's,</b>

04:32.140 --> 04:34.810
<b>but he does have some skills.</b>

04:34.900 --> 04:38.400
<b>He's more than qualified
to be a bodyguard.</b>

04:38.480 --> 04:41.650
<b>Of course, this isn't a decision
I made on my own.</b>

04:41.740 --> 04:44.490
<b>It has been approved by Lady Itsukihime.</b>

04:44.570 --> 04:46.280
<b>Isn't that right, My Lady?</b>

04:47.070 --> 04:47.990
<b>Yes.</b>

04:48.080 --> 04:50.910
<b>It's true that there have
been more demons lately.</b>

04:50.990 --> 04:52.660
<b>Indeed, we must take countermeasures.</b>

04:54.580 --> 04:55.750
<b>Jinta.</b>

04:55.830 --> 04:57.920
<b>I trust you have no objections?</b>

04:58.000 --> 04:59.040
<b>Yes.</b>

04:59.130 --> 05:02.050
<b>As long as it's to keep Lady Itsukihime
safe, I have no complaints.</b>

05:02.710 --> 05:03.880
<b>Very well.</b>

05:03.970 --> 05:09.640
<b>I'm counting on you two Guardians
to keep Lady Itsukihime and Kadono safe.</b>

05:11.470 --> 05:13.350
<b>Let's look out for each other from now on.</b>

05:13.430 --> 05:14.890
<b>Right, Jinta?</b>

05:27.160 --> 05:28.240
<b>Hey, Shirayuki.</b>

05:28.320 --> 05:29.700
<b>Look at that person…</b>

05:30.910 --> 05:31.740
<b>Him?</b>

05:31.830 --> 05:33.910
<b>He's the village chief's son, Kiyomasa.</b>

05:34.000 --> 05:35.080
<b>I see.</b>

05:42.050 --> 05:43.050
<b>Kiyomasa.</b>

05:44.590 --> 05:47.340
<b>Please gear up and serve
as my bodyguard from now on.</b>

05:47.800 --> 05:48.890
<b>Got it.</b>

05:48.970 --> 05:49.970
<b>As for Jinta,</b>

05:50.050 --> 05:52.970
<b>I need to talk to you
before you head out on your mission.</b>

05:53.060 --> 05:54.770
<b>Please stay behind.</b>

05:54.850 --> 05:55.850
<b>As you command.</b>

05:56.890 --> 05:59.650
<b>Well then,
you're all dismissed for the night.</b>

06:05.780 --> 06:08.240
<b>A second Shrine Maiden's Guardian, huh?</b>

06:11.280 --> 06:14.490
<b>Although I know it's unavoidable…</b>

06:14.580 --> 06:17.330
<b>No matter what others plan,
I'm still a Shrine Maiden's Guardian.</b>

06:17.410 --> 06:19.290
<b>I won't back down from that.</b>

06:20.290 --> 06:22.630
<b>Then I'll do my best as the Itsukihime</b>

06:22.710 --> 06:25.010
<b>in response to your resolve.</b>

06:29.680 --> 06:31.680
<b>As soon as Kiyomasa comes back,</b>

06:31.760 --> 06:33.390
<b>I'll head out right away.</b>

06:33.930 --> 06:34.770
<b>Mhm.</b>

06:34.850 --> 06:35.930
<b>I'm counting on you.</b>

06:36.020 --> 06:38.270
<b>But don't let your guard down.</b>

06:38.350 --> 06:39.850
<b>And be careful not to get hurt.</b>

06:39.940 --> 06:42.020
<b>Your big sister here
will be worried about you.</b>

06:42.610 --> 06:44.860
<b>Why are you always like this?</b>

06:45.610 --> 06:47.610
<b>Now's the time to say,
"May fortune favor your sword,"</b>

06:47.690 --> 06:49.240
<b>and send me off.</b>

06:55.080 --> 06:56.790
<b>Brother, welcome home!</b>

06:57.250 --> 06:58.080
<b>Mhm.</b>

06:58.160 --> 06:59.330
<b>Is everything all right at home?</b>

06:59.410 --> 07:01.290
<b>Yes, everything's fine.</b>

07:01.790 --> 07:04.710
<b>I'm sorry, but I've been
assigned another mission.</b>

07:05.300 --> 07:07.420
<b>What? Again?</b>

07:15.720 --> 07:16.850
<b>Well then, I'm off.</b>

07:19.430 --> 07:20.850
<b>Don't worry.</b>

07:20.940 --> 07:22.770
<b>I won't fail against a mere demon.</b>

07:22.860 --> 07:23.690
<b>Okay.</b>

07:23.770 --> 07:26.110
<b>But please be careful.</b>

07:26.190 --> 07:28.110
<b>I know. I'll be back soon.</b>

07:28.190 --> 07:29.490
<b>Wait for me at home.</b>

07:29.570 --> 07:30.700
<b>Okay.</b>

07:31.360 --> 07:35.160
<b>It'd be great if you could always stay
by Lady Itsukihime's side as her guardian.</b>

07:37.080 --> 07:38.080
<b>What's wrong?</b>

07:38.500 --> 07:39.540
<b>Nothing.</b>

07:39.620 --> 07:40.460
<b>Oh, right.</b>

07:40.540 --> 07:43.580
<b>Suzune, do you remember Kiyomasa?</b>

07:43.670 --> 07:45.170
<b>Kiyomasa?</b>

07:45.250 --> 07:46.670
<b>Who's that?</b>

07:46.750 --> 07:48.300
<b>He's the village chief's son.</b>

07:49.510 --> 07:50.510
<b>I see.</b>

07:51.220 --> 07:53.720
<b>Sorry, I asked a weird question.</b>

07:53.800 --> 07:55.010
<b>I'll get going then.</b>

07:55.100 --> 07:57.100
<b>Okay, be safe.</b>

08:22.660 --> 08:24.040
<b>You're back, Jinta.</b>

08:24.880 --> 08:26.080
<b>From that look on your face,</b>

08:26.170 --> 08:29.000
<b>don't tell me you're reporting
to Byakuya empty-handed again?</b>

08:29.090 --> 08:30.170
<b>Yes.</b>

08:30.260 --> 08:33.680
<b>Please do your job properly, Guardian.</b>

08:33.760 --> 08:34.890
<b>I'll do my best.</b>

08:34.970 --> 08:36.510
<b>Are you really?</b>

08:36.600 --> 08:38.970
<b>What about your bodyguard work?</b>

08:39.060 --> 08:42.060
<b>Aren't I on patrol right now?</b>

08:42.140 --> 08:43.640
<b>But if I have to keep watch,</b>

08:43.730 --> 08:47.980
<b>I'd much rather be in Byakuya's room,
watching her sleep.</b>

08:48.070 --> 08:49.480
<b>Kiyomasa.</b>

08:49.570 --> 08:52.900
<b>At least mind your words
and actions outside the shrine.</b>

08:52.990 --> 08:55.910
<b>Don't address Lady Itsukihime
with such a frivolous name.</b>

08:55.990 --> 08:57.620
<b>It makes no difference.</b>

08:57.700 --> 09:00.700
<b>Byakuya was the one
who said I could call her that.</b>

09:00.790 --> 09:02.000
<b>What did you say?</b>

09:03.250 --> 09:04.620
<b>Don't glare at me like that.</b>

09:16.300 --> 09:17.220
<b>Lady Itsukihime,</b>

09:17.300 --> 09:18.680
<b>allow me to report.</b>

09:19.470 --> 09:22.560
<b>I have yet to find any traces of a demon.</b>

09:22.640 --> 09:24.020
<b>I apologize.</b>

09:24.640 --> 09:25.520
<b>Don't blame yourself.</b>

09:25.600 --> 09:28.770
<b>It won't be resolved easily
in a day or two.</b>

09:28.860 --> 09:32.730
<b>It's better to proceed with care
than to rush things and fail.</b>

09:33.240 --> 09:37.410
<b>After all, the sword you wield is the key
to Kadono's peace and future.</b>

09:38.820 --> 09:40.490
<b>Thank you for your understanding.</b>

09:40.580 --> 09:42.490
<b>Byakuya, you're too lenient with him.</b>

09:42.580 --> 09:45.540
<b>Since he failed,
you should give him a stern scolding.</b>

09:46.250 --> 09:47.330
<b>Kiyomasa.</b>

09:48.000 --> 09:52.130
<b>As a Shrine Maiden's Guardian,
please mind your speech and conduct.</b>

09:52.210 --> 09:53.960
<b>There's no need to be so uptight.</b>

09:54.880 --> 09:56.430
<b>All right, Jinta.</b>

09:56.510 --> 09:59.220
<b>Please gear up
and continue your investigation.</b>

09:59.300 --> 10:01.720
<b>Go and find out the true nature
of the creature.</b>

10:01.810 --> 10:02.810
<b>As you command.</b>

10:03.310 --> 10:04.980
<b>Kiyomasa, during this period,</b>

10:05.060 --> 10:06.480
<b>please continue serving as my bodyguard.</b>

10:06.560 --> 10:08.520
<b>I know.</b>

10:08.850 --> 10:12.020
<b>I'll do my best to protect you.</b>

10:13.030 --> 10:14.900
<b>Don't worry too much, Jinta.</b>

10:14.990 --> 10:18.070
<b>I'll be the one
to keep her safe and sound.</b>

10:26.210 --> 10:27.210
<b>Hey.</b>

10:29.460 --> 10:30.710
<b>What's this?</b>

10:30.790 --> 10:32.380
<b>A sweet steamed bun.</b>

10:32.460 --> 10:34.590
<b>A peddler happened to pass by,
so I bought it.</b>

10:36.220 --> 10:37.720
<b>It's not for you.</b>

10:38.470 --> 10:40.840
<b>That child doesn't go out often, right?</b>

10:40.930 --> 10:43.010
<b>She'll probably crave something sweet
every now and then.</b>

10:43.680 --> 10:45.720
<b>Why do you care about Suzune?</b>

10:46.350 --> 10:48.100
<b>Between you and Suzune…</b>

10:48.190 --> 10:49.730
<b>It's nothing.</b>

10:49.810 --> 10:51.310
<b>It's just that I understand her.</b>

10:51.400 --> 10:54.690
<b>Because we're the same type of person.</b>

10:54.780 --> 10:56.360
<b>I understand her pain too.</b>

10:58.900 --> 11:01.570
<b>But I'm not as strong as she is.</b>

11:03.280 --> 11:04.280
<b>Thank you.</b>

11:04.660 --> 11:06.500
<b>Instead of thanking me,</b>

11:06.580 --> 11:09.080
<b>why don't you apologize to Suzune?</b>

11:09.160 --> 11:10.920
<b>For making her feel so lonely.</b>

11:43.530 --> 11:45.870
<b>Should I continue upstream?</b>

11:45.950 --> 11:47.830
<b>Or should I go deeper into the forest?</b>

11:48.580 --> 11:49.790
<b>What should I do?</b>

12:22.110 --> 12:24.950
<b>An ape-like… creature?</b>

12:45.050 --> 12:47.680
<b>So it doesn't just look like an ape?</b>

12:48.850 --> 12:49.930
<b>You're not getting away!</b>

13:31.890 --> 13:33.810
<b>Here you go, three dango skewers.</b>

13:33.890 --> 13:35.270
<b>Thank you.</b>

13:35.350 --> 13:36.600
<b>They look delicious.</b>

13:36.690 --> 13:38.770
<b>Chitose, I'll come again.</b>

13:38.860 --> 13:40.860
<b>Thank you for your patronage.</b>

13:42.480 --> 13:44.150
<b>What happened to you?!</b>

13:46.200 --> 13:47.570
<b>Jinta!</b>

13:51.830 --> 13:53.870
<b>Are you okay, Jinta?</b>

13:53.950 --> 13:55.500
<b>Hey, go get the village chief!</b>

13:55.580 --> 13:56.790
<b>- Hurry!
- Jinta!</b>

13:56.870 --> 13:58.080
<b>Jinta!</b>

14:10.100 --> 14:11.560
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:11.640 --> 14:13.470
<b>What are you apologizing for?</b>

14:13.560 --> 14:15.270
<b>Not only was I injured,</b>

14:15.350 --> 14:17.100
<b>but I also let that creature escape.</b>

14:17.850 --> 14:18.980
<b>It's all right.</b>

14:19.440 --> 14:24.530
<b>Right now, all the men in the village
are on guard around the shrine.</b>

14:24.610 --> 14:27.070
<b>Just one word from the Itsukihime,
and that creature's nothing.</b>

14:27.150 --> 14:28.200
<b>But…</b>

14:28.660 --> 14:30.280
<b>I already said it's all right.</b>

14:30.370 --> 14:31.530
<b>And besides,</b>

14:32.200 --> 14:34.910
<b>what matters most
is that you're back safe and sound.</b>

14:36.330 --> 14:37.500
<b>I'm sorry.</b>

14:39.290 --> 14:40.460
<b>There you go again.</b>

14:49.090 --> 14:52.390
<b>I knew it. Having you around, Jinta,</b>

14:52.470 --> 14:53.850
<b>really puts me at ease.</b>

14:57.430 --> 14:58.890
<b>You're covered in wounds now, though.</b>

14:59.600 --> 15:01.650
<b>You'd feel reassured
even if I'm covered in wounds?</b>

15:08.700 --> 15:10.160
<b>Oh, that.</b>

15:10.240 --> 15:11.570
<b>That's the book Kiyomasa brought.</b>

15:11.660 --> 15:13.370
<b>Kiyomasa's?</b>

15:14.280 --> 15:16.660
<b>You know how things
have been chaotic lately…</b>

15:16.750 --> 15:17.830
<b>And besides,</b>

15:17.910 --> 15:20.620
<b>I'm not supposed
to go out freely in the first place.</b>

15:20.710 --> 15:23.670
<b>So he brought me some reading books
to relieve my boredom.</b>

15:24.630 --> 15:26.170
<b>I see.</b>

15:28.420 --> 15:29.590
<b>Speaking of Kiyomasa,</b>

15:29.680 --> 15:31.840
<b>he seems to be writing
a reading book himself.</b>

15:31.930 --> 15:35.760
<b>He blushed so hard
when I said I wanted to read it.</b>

15:35.850 --> 15:38.390
<b>His face was all red.</b>

15:38.480 --> 15:39.480
<b>Jinta?</b>

15:40.270 --> 15:42.150
<b>No. It's nothing.</b>

15:42.730 --> 15:44.110
<b>Is that so?</b>

15:53.370 --> 15:56.080
<b>M-Monster.</b>

15:56.160 --> 15:57.790
<b>A real monster.</b>

16:28.070 --> 16:29.110
<b>Jinta!</b>

16:29.190 --> 16:30.030
<b>Kiyomasa.</b>

16:30.110 --> 16:31.110
<b>Stay by Shirayuki…</b>

16:31.990 --> 16:33.780
<b>Stay by Lady Itsukihime and protect her.</b>

16:33.860 --> 16:34.780
<b>But…</b>

16:34.870 --> 16:35.870
<b>Stay out of this.</b>

16:36.410 --> 16:38.540
<b>I'll take care of it.</b>

16:48.920 --> 16:50.460
<b>Why am I…</b>

16:52.420 --> 16:54.220
<b>so distraught?</b>

17:06.770 --> 17:09.530
<b>Don't worry too much.</b>

17:11.030 --> 17:13.280
<b>It's getting stronger?</b>

17:26.540 --> 17:31.880
<b>I'll be the one…
to keep her safe and sound.</b>

17:54.490 --> 17:57.610
<b>A creature that preys
on people's emotional weaknesses?</b>

17:59.660 --> 18:02.240
<b>You really love pulling this kind
of irritating trick, huh?</b>

18:05.160 --> 18:07.790
<b>She gave up her own happiness</b>

18:07.880 --> 18:10.790
<b>to pray for the safety of others.</b>

18:10.880 --> 18:12.630
<b>That was the vow she made.</b>

18:14.260 --> 18:16.300
<b>It was that very belief</b>

18:17.180 --> 18:19.800
<b>that made me decide
to become the sword that protects her.</b>

18:21.600 --> 18:23.270
<b>A cheap trick like this</b>

18:25.730 --> 18:27.190
<b>won't sway me.</b>

19:05.060 --> 19:06.350
<b>Shirayuki.</b>

19:07.940 --> 19:09.140
<b>You're already…</b>

19:10.440 --> 19:11.770
<b>deep in slumber.</b>

19:28.750 --> 19:31.120
<b>In this body I now inhabit as a demon,</b>

19:31.210 --> 19:34.460
<b>time passes far too slowly,</b>

19:34.550 --> 19:40.180
<b>yet it never once stops or ceases.</b>

19:40.260 --> 19:43.100
<b>It piles up endlessly, layer upon layer.</b>

19:45.850 --> 19:47.600
<b>And within this flow of time,</b>

19:47.680 --> 19:50.640
<b>humans weave their lives together,
whether fleeting or lasting.</b>

19:59.240 --> 20:03.160
<b>Even as they tangle and tear apart,
without a final goodbye.</b>

20:15.380 --> 20:16.420
<b>Wait for me!</b>

20:16.500 --> 20:19.970
<b>- All right, let's race to the other side!
- Bro, Sis, wait for me!</b>

20:21.720 --> 20:23.010
<b>Shirayuki.</b>

20:24.640 --> 20:25.850
<b>At that time,</b>

20:26.390 --> 20:29.270
<b>my sword did kill that creature.</b>

20:30.390 --> 20:33.100
<b>But my heart…</b>

20:33.190 --> 20:35.020
<b>what did I truly sever?</b>

20:46.910 --> 20:50.250
<b>Countless seasons
have already come and gone,</b>

20:50.330 --> 20:52.210
<b>and the times have quietly changed.</b>

20:54.580 --> 20:57.460
<b>Second Year of Bunkyu</b>

20:57.570 --> 20:59.460
<b>Sword Shop,</b>

20:57.570 --> 20:59.460
<b>Tamagawa</b>

21:01.720 --> 21:04.680
<b>Is there something
you're not satisfied with, Mr. Miura?</b>

21:05.300 --> 21:07.300
<b>There's nothing wrong with it.</b>

21:07.390 --> 21:09.560
<b>It's just that this sword…</b>

21:10.810 --> 21:11.730
<b>No.</b>

21:11.810 --> 21:14.900
<b>I should say that I've never
been on a real battlefield.</b>

21:14.980 --> 21:18.900
<b>Is it really okay for a samurai's sword
to be so untainted and pristine?</b>

21:19.820 --> 21:22.900
<b>You're as serious as ever.</b>

21:22.990 --> 21:24.610
<b>If you can't feel at ease,</b>

21:24.700 --> 21:27.490
<b>why don't you take a look
at this fascinating sword?</b>

21:27.570 --> 21:29.450
<b>It'll cheer you up.</b>

21:31.120 --> 21:32.410
<b>I'm truly grateful.</b>

21:40.630 --> 21:43.260
<b>The sword's inscription reads "Kaneomi."</b>

21:45.930 --> 21:47.090
<b>May I unsheathe it?</b>

21:47.180 --> 21:48.180
<b>Go ahead.</b>

21:51.010 --> 21:53.350
<b>This… This sword.</b>

21:55.230 --> 21:56.810
<b>It's truly magnificent.</b>

21:56.900 --> 21:59.270
<b>In the ironmasters' village of Kadono,</b>

21:59.360 --> 22:03.490
<b>the one hailed as the number one
swordsmith is none other than Kaneomi.</b>

22:03.570 --> 22:05.820
<b>A deep curvature and a thick, solid blade</b>

22:05.900 --> 22:07.410
<b>with a simple straight hamon</b>

22:07.490 --> 22:10.990
<b>showcase craftsmanship
designed for real combat.</b>

22:11.080 --> 22:13.750
<b>This is indeed a sword forged for combat.</b>

22:13.830 --> 22:15.870
<b>And yet, it retains all its elegance.</b>

22:15.960 --> 22:18.130
<b>It's truly amazing.</b>

22:18.210 --> 22:21.090
<b>But I've never heard of the name Kaneomi.</b>

22:21.170 --> 22:24.340
<b>Because most of his swords
don't have inscriptions.</b>

22:24.420 --> 22:27.260
<b>There aren't many people who know him.</b>

22:27.800 --> 22:28.970
<b>That may be so,</b>

22:29.050 --> 22:32.600
<b>but he's considered quite famous in a way.</b>

22:32.680 --> 22:33.600
<b>What do you mean?</b>

22:33.680 --> 22:36.310
<b>Actually, amidst Kaneomi's works,</b>

22:36.390 --> 22:39.610
<b>there are four unique swords.</b>

22:39.690 --> 22:43.570
<b>If it had been three days ago,
I could've shown you one of them.</b>

22:43.650 --> 22:45.030
<b>Only four swords.</b>

22:45.110 --> 22:46.990
<b>They're that famous and powerful?</b>

22:47.070 --> 22:47.990
<b>No.</b>

22:48.070 --> 22:49.990
<b>It's what people call…</b>

22:50.070 --> 22:52.870
<b>a demonic sword.</b>

22:52.950 --> 22:54.120
<b>A demonic sword?</b>

22:54.200 --> 22:57.290
<b>Rumor has it that Kaneomi
had dealings with demons</b>

22:57.370 --> 23:01.340
<b>and forged swords imbued
with demonic power.</b>

23:01.420 --> 23:04.090
<b>Is that kind of thing even possible?</b>

23:04.170 --> 23:06.720
<b>It's said that demons came
and went from his forge.</b>

23:06.800 --> 23:09.260
<b>Some say he was married to a demon.</b>

23:09.340 --> 23:13.180
<b>There's even a legend that he forged
a sword by melting his wife into the iron.</b>

23:13.260 --> 23:16.270
<b>In any case, there are countless
rumors circulating around Kaneomi.</b>

23:16.350 --> 23:19.190
<b>You said one of those swords was here.</b>

23:19.270 --> 23:22.270
<b>So you still sold it,
knowing it was a demonic sword?</b>

23:22.360 --> 23:25.570
<b>It was bought by a samurai
of the Aizu Domain residing in Edo.</b>

23:25.650 --> 23:27.190
<b>We merchants have a business to run.</b>

23:27.280 --> 23:28.570
<b>Whether it's good or evil,</b>

23:28.650 --> 23:31.950
<b>we'll naturally sell it
if someone offers a price.</b>

23:32.030 --> 23:33.160
<b>I see.</b>

23:33.240 --> 23:35.580
<b>So, what's the name of that demonic sword?</b>

23:36.660 --> 23:39.830
<b>Yatonomori Kaneomi.</b>
